---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Home">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">WT / Offensive Security Research</p>
    <h1>Understand systems.<br />Challenge assumptions.</h1>
    <p class="lead">WhateverTakes is a four-member security research team connecting infrastructure learning with vulnerability discovery and reproducible security engineering.</p>
    <p lang="ko" class="muted">인프라를 이해하고 보안 경계를 검증합니다. 재현 가능한 연구와 외부에서 검증할 수 있는 기여를 지향합니다.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/research/">Research direction</a><a class="button" href="/blog/">Research blog</a></div>
  </section>
  <p class="eyebrow">Research areas</p>
  <div class="grid">
    <section class="panel"><h3>01 / Infrastructure</h3><p>Linux, networks, containers, cloud concepts and security boundaries.</p></section>
    <section class="panel"><h3>02 / Vulnerability research</h3><p>Authorized testing, open-source code review, fuzzing and coordinated disclosure.</p></section>
    <section class="panel"><h3>03 / Security engineering</h3><p>Reproducible experiments, automation and human-verified AI-assisted analysis.</p></section>
  </div>
  <h2>Selected project</h2>
  <div class="panel"><h3><a href="https://github.com/whatevertakes/CTF-OS">CTF-OS ↗</a></h3><p>Challenge-scoped Codex engine for human-selected CTF problems in isolated environments. Competition performance is not yet established.</p></div>
  <h2>Meet the team</h2><p>Four researchers, individual portfolios and a shared research direction.</p><a href="/members/">Team profiles →</a>
</Base>
